  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nThis recipe was created with the vision of a sweet, warm atmosphere, as if a thin layer of honey were covering a photo. This recipe reveals the hidden stories in everyday life, as if you were turning the pages of a picture book. I adjusted the grading and midtones to create a soft tone with a touch of warmth. This recipe shows its magic in a location abundant with the greens and yellows of trees and grass. Portrait photography during early morning or evening is particularly suitable when gentle backlighting enhances the image. The secret is setting your exposure slightly brighter when shooting.",
